{"id":"vod_bf_16006","vodId":"16006","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"结城友奈是勇者","name_cn":"结城友奈是勇者","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-17/2e6b4758e968d8d57836c9ba4c26846c.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在神世纪300年，表面看来，结城友奈（照井春佳 配音）是一个平凡的初中二年级女生，个性开朗热情的她是校园中的活跃分子，深受老师和朋友们的喜爱。可实际上，放课后的她还有着另一重身份——勇者部的部员。　　友奈的邻居兼好友，沉默寡言却意外的温柔的东乡美森（三森铃子 配音）、个性大大咧咧果断直率，却意外的擅长做家务的犬吠埼风（内山夕实 配音）、风的妹妹，像小动物一样惹人怜爱的犬吠埼树（黑泽朋世 配音）、看似桀骜不驯难以接近，实际上非常害羞傲娇的三好夏凛（长妻树里 配音），除了友奈，活跃在勇者部的是这些性格迥异的女孩们，她们所要面对的，是名为巴提克的强大敌人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 22:15:46","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhe/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhe/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhe/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhe/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhe/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhe/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhe/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhe/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhe/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhe/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhe/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiechengyounaishiyongzhe/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:5